  "closure_requirements": [
    "Keep market.stk_limit as the first LocalSIM authority and call TDX exactly once only for refresh-unavailable, legal-zero-row, requested-symbol-missing, or null-pre-close availability gaps.",
    "Reject duplicate, alias, cross-date, non-finite, non-positive, inverted-bound, unknown-board, stale-reference, and hash/reference corruption without masking them through TDX.",
    "Freeze a hash-closed DailyTradingContextV2 through pre-trade decision, execution plan, persisted readback, and minute hot-path consumption with zero intraday market SQL or limit recomputation.",
    "Preserve exact symbol intents and isolate unavailable symbols without reallocating quantity, cash, positions, fills, TWAP, OMS, gateway, or broker route semantics.",
    "Run required verification plans and itemized DESIGN-COMPLIANCE-001 review.",
    "Keep BUG JSON and GitHub Issue synchronized."
  ],
